WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.169
-As I said earlier, the
Kentucky Derby is this Saturday.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.371
Now, usually, there's a horse
that's a clear favorite,

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.606
but not this year.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.607
It's nearly impossible
to predict the winner.

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:09.809
Well, you guys are in luck

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.444
because, when it comes
to predicting things,

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.946
we have a secret weapon,
and it's puppies.

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:15.214
-Aww.
-Whoo!

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.349
-That's right,
ladies and gentlemen --

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.951
it's time
for the Puppy Predictors,

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:20.220
2021 Kentucky Derby Edition.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.423
-♪ Puppy predictors ♪

00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:28.060
♪ Puppy predictors ♪

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.563
-Welcome to
the Puppy Predictors,

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:33.099
2021 Kentucky Derby Edition.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:36.669
Here's how it works -- we have
10 adorable rescue puppies

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:39.105
from North Shore Animal League
America,

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.874
each representing one
of the top 10 horses

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.909
competing
in Saturday's big race,

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:46.412
and one giant trough of kibble.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.715
Whichever puppy crosses
the finish line

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.583
and reaches the trough first

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.952
will be crowned
the Kentucky Derby winner.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.555
Now, let's meet the puppies.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.390
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.659
♪♪

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.994
I got -- Hi, everybody.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.063
I know. I see you.
Hi, buddy.

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:06.766
Hi. I see you.
Hi, cutie. Hi, guys.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:07.967
Oh, my.
They're ready to go.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.868
Alright, lined up
at the starting gate,

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:13.406
we have Tigger representing
Essential Quality.

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.642
We have Maddie
for Rock Your World.

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:20.313
We have Reese for Known Agenda.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.182
We have Addy
for Hot Rod Charlie.

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:26.051
We have Dorothy
for Highly Motivated.

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:28.287
Dorothy.
Wake up, Dorothy.

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.924
Dorothy.
Get ready, Dorothy.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.426
Dorothy. Now's the time
to shine, Dorothy.

00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:36.195
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.930
Not gonna happen.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.632
Not going to happen.
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.734
She made a choice early on --
yeah, nope.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.504
We have Duncan for Mandaloun.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:48.174
We have Keira for Medina Spirit.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.409
We have Delilah
for Midnight Bourbon.

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:51.711
Delilah.

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.579
Ooh, look at -- look at Sissy.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:56.048
Look at Sissy,
ready to go for King Fury.

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:57.116
Hi, Sissy.

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:58.617
And finally, we have Tiger

00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:01.287
representing the long shot,
Dynamic One.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.422
Tiger's not even looking
at the finish line.

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:05.324
[ Laughter and applause ]
Now, guys, before I release you,

00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:07.060
listen up --
Tiger, you, as well --

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.028
no butt-sniffing, no cheating,
okay?

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.830
Let's make this a fair race.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.465
First one to the trough wins --
okay? --

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.466
and wins the Kentucky Derby.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.934
You guys got it?

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.002
Alright, cool.
Here we go.

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.202
Roots, whenever you're ready.

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:22.775
[ "First Call" plays ]

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.977
Okay.
Release the puppies!

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:26.212
♪♪

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.948
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.717
Hi, guys.
No, that way. Oh.

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:33.453
And we have a winner! Whoa!
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.354
Hi, buddy.
[ Chuckling ] I know.

00:02:35.354 --> 00:02:37.223
Okay. I know. I know.
Hi, buddy.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.092
Oh, God. Wow. Are you kidding?
How cute is that?

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:42.228
Oh, I know. You didn't win,
but, gosh, you're cute.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:43.896
Alright, oh.
Go over to Higgins.

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:46.265
There's the winner right here.
Oh, my goodness.

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:47.900
Hate to bring you away
from the food there, buddy.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.003
There you go. Alright.
Come on up here, buddy.

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:52.872
Essential Quality is the winner

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.307
of the Kentucky Derby,
everybody.

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:55.674
[ Cheers and applause ]
Look at this guy.

00:02:55.674 --> 00:02:57.576
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:57.576 --> 00:02:59.946
If you'd like to adopt
one of these puppies,

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.381
go to animalleague.org.

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:05.050
He's so cute.
Enjoy the race. Stick around.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.753
We'll be back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.854
Go, go, go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:08.854 --> 00:03:11.491
Enjoy. Hi! Hi!

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:14.226
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:18.064
♪♪

